WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
Speaker 1: All right, welcome to the show,&nbsp;
it's going to be a big, big vaccine show&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:09.520
today. Why? Because the approval of the Fizer&nbsp;
vaccine by the FDA happened. We said yesterday&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:14.320
it was expected to happen yesterday. It happened&nbsp;
within hours of us recording the show, publishing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:20.640
the show. And important to remember, this is&nbsp;
this is Pfizer. Moderna is a few weeks behind,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:24.800
but a very, very important development&nbsp;
for a number of different reasons. The New&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:31.280
York Times reporting the FDA grants full&nbsp;
approval to the Pfizer biotech covid-19&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:38.400
vaccine. The FDA granted full approval for&nbsp;
the Pfizer vaccine for people 16 and older,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:42.960
making it the first to move beyond emergency use&nbsp;
status in the United States. As we talked about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:49.040
yesterday, about a third of those refusing the&nbsp;
vaccine said if and when there is full approval,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:54.400
they will go and get the vaccine. And so now&nbsp;
it's time to figure out whether they really will.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:00.240
We are going to talk about the vaccine&nbsp;
requirements that are coming down as a result.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:06.240
And The New York Times also pointing out the&nbsp;
decision is sure to set off a cascade of vaccine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:12.080
requirements by hospitals, colleges, corporations&nbsp;
and others. The Pentagon responded immediately,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:17.680
saying all active duty service members&nbsp;
will be required to be vaccinated.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:24.000
Oregon has adopted a vaccine requirement&nbsp;
for state workers. In a brief speech Monday,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.840
President Biden said he hoped the approval would&nbsp;
prompt many of the roughly 85 million Americans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:36.800
who are unvaccinated and eligible for shots&nbsp;
to get them. So what are the important things&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:42.880
to remember? I already mentioned this is the&nbsp;
Pfizer approval many people have gotten. Moderna&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:49.600
Moderna is not yet fully approved, still&nbsp;
approved under emergency use. Moderna a few&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:55.200
weeks behind in the pipeline. They filed for full&nbsp;
approval shortly after Pfizer did. And it would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.200 --> 00:02:00.640
be expected that within a few weeks that vaccine&nbsp;
would be approved as well. Again, important to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:06.720
remember that what the FDA has approved here&nbsp;
is the two dose regimen, which is the standard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:11.600
emergency use regimen for both the Pfizer and&nbsp;
the Moderna vaccine. There are people writing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:17.680
to me and I briefly addressed this yesterday.&nbsp;
Well, so they've approved the two shot regimen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:22.240
but they're already talking about a third dose&nbsp;
at the eight month mark. Immunocompromised&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:25.920
folks have already started getting a&nbsp;
third dose. There's Israeli data about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:32.640
the efficacy of a third dose that's not currently&nbsp;
approved fully. And the expectation is that Pfizer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:38.080
will immediately ask for that third booster shot&nbsp;
at the eight month mark to be approved as well.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:44.720
For now, the World Health Organization is leaning&nbsp;
towards stick with two, let's use those would be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:49.280
third doses and get them to countries and to&nbsp;
people that haven't even had a single dose yet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:53.200
that's going to help us get out of the pandemic&nbsp;
more quickly. It's not a crazy thing to suggest,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:58.720
but in the United States, there is going to&nbsp;
be the availability. I got my flu shot at CVS&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:06.720
the other day and the pharmacist said we have the&nbsp;
supply. They do Moderna at least that CVS did.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:10.880
And they said once you're at eight months, you can&nbsp;
just come get a third dose. We're not going to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:16.400
restricting it to certain groups or whatever&nbsp;
the case may be. So now we'll start really&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:21.520
there's now we're branching. We had one branch&nbsp;
office which was waiting for full approval. We&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:26.800
now have that that's been met. We now have two new&nbsp;
branches to look at. One, do the people who said,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:32.240
I'll get it once it's fully approved, do they&nbsp;
stick to what they said? My prediction is some do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:37.520
and some move the goalposts. We already saw some&nbsp;
of the goalpost moving yesterday. It was exactly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:43.280
as I predicted it was the approval too quick?&nbsp;
Was the approval politicized? Was the approval&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:49.600
rushed? The question being asked on Fox News, a&nbsp;
guest on Steve Bannon's program saying this isn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:54.560
even really an approval. We'll get to all of that&nbsp;
later. That's number one. And then number two,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.360 --> 00:04:01.440
we are we were expecting and we're already seeing&nbsp;
and we'll talk about it later on in the program.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:07.040
A whole bunch of new organizations putting in&nbsp;
place vaccination requirements. We're seeing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:12.640
more schools and colleges. We're seeing more&nbsp;
cities, say even just to go to restaurants.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:20.480
And I'm curious to see, will there be hotel&nbsp;
chains that say this is a vaccinated only hotel?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:25.840
That sounds pretty good to me. I would lean&nbsp;
towards going to that hotel chain if I needed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:30.880
to go to a hotel and there was a chain that did&nbsp;
that. Is there an airline that's willing to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:36.320
the first to say, you're going to need a vaccine&nbsp;
to fly with us after a certain date? I would be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:42.880
very interested in trying to fly that airline.&nbsp;
And it should not come as a shock that there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:50.240
are millions of people who will say, I would&nbsp;
never do that. I will quit my job if they say or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:55.920
I will never fly that airline or whatever. I&nbsp;
think for some of them that will apply, but for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.920 --> 00:05:00.240
many others as soon as it becomes inconvenient.&nbsp;
To be unvaccinated, they are going to go and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:05.360
they are going to get themselves vaccinated&nbsp;
because people value convenience significantly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:10.000
and we're going to talk about that a little&nbsp;
bit later. But next, I do want to talk about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:17.680
the Pentagon mandating vaccination for all one&nbsp;
point three million active duty service members.

